# P92 on Windows GtkBackend (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4), run with SCUI_P92_MENU=1: the steps of actions/win/P92-edit-menu.actions -- Select All, Copy, Paste, Undo, Redo through the Edit menu, then the app's own AFTER-undoRedo item.
# Positions read 2026-10-20 from a desktop capture with the Edit menu open (its popover exposes nothing to UIA), frame pixels (GTK is not scaled): Edit (151,64); items at x 178: Undo 96, Redo 126, AFTER-undoRedo 156, Copy 229, Paste 259, Select All 319. Field (323,216), its text end (425,216).
# Expected: field hellohello after Paste, hello after Undo, hellohello after Redo, then last command: AFTER-undoRedo.
# P92(Windows GTK,SCUI_P92_MENU=1):經 Edit 選單全選、複製、貼上，再復原、重做，最後點 app 自己的項目。預期結果見上方英文。
